{"id":"promesa","lemma":"promesa","pos":"noun","rank":1483,"glosses":["promise"],"ipa":"/pɾoˈmesa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"promesas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-promesa.wav","examples":[{"text":"No hago ninguna promesa.","en":"I made no promises.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152123"},{"text":"Nunca cumple sus promesas.","en":"He never keeps his word.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524820"},{"text":"No hice esa promesa.","en":"I made no such promise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460275"},{"text":"Siempre mantengo mis promesas.","en":"I always keep my promises.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64961"},{"text":"No olvides tu promesa.","en":"Don't forget your promise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594671"}]}